// v23.xx (gfx41), HIS ORDER 2026-10-12 (the graphics program, item 15, TV and 4K readability): 4K EFFECT SIZES AND ACTOR HALOS.
// The world is drawn bigger at 4K (ZOOM grows with hudRes), but a tracer and a spark kept their thin 1080p proportions next to
// bodies drawn with more detail, so a burst of fire read as hairlines on a TV. gfxFXK() is 1 at 1080p and grows to 1.25 at 4K
// (1 + 0.25 x clamp(hudRes - 1, 0, 1)); the tracers and the sparks are drawn that much thicker. And at 4K, or with HUD SIZE LARGE
// FOR TV, every actor you can see (VIS, the same canSee gate as the bodies, so nothing hidden gets one) and the player stand on a
// soft dark contrast halo, a sprite baked once and stamped under the y-sorted bodies, so a body reads against a busy floor from a
